        "product_summary": "Retro low-top profile: A closed rounded toe, low collar and dark sole give this lace-up shoe a clean casual outline.\n\nContrasting side bands: Two stitched diagonal bands cross the quarter, paired with a contrasting rear panel and wraparound forefoot overlay.\n\nLace adjustment: The front eyelet row allows the lacing to be adjusted over the tongue; the source close-up shows the actual construction.\n\nTextured rubber sole: Fine texture and short edge grooves are visible around the dark outsole in the side photographs.\n\nTwo colour directions: White and Black are listed in EU36-42 for wholesale colour-size assortments.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
